REFRIGERATED,PRODUCT OF USART97r#1029rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 40 min or gas grill
.  10 min with lid closed. Season or
.  marinate 1/2 lb. ribs per person.
2. Grill 4" above Med-Low heat. Hold
.  palm just above grate. If heat
.  causes you to pull away in 5
.  seconds, heat is ideal (325 deg).
3. Cook 35 min with lid closed. Turn
.  and baste after 15 and 25 min.
.  Cook to 160 deg internal temp.
OPTIONS: Broil, Roast, BraiseRT97r#1037rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 40 min or gas grill
.  10 min with lid closed. Season or
.  marinate 1/2 lb. ribs per person.
2. Grill 4" above Med-Low heat. Hold
.  palm just above grate. If heat
.  causes you to pull away in 5
.  seconds, heat is ideal (325 deg).
3. Cook 40 min with lid closed. Turn
.  and baste after 20 and 30 min.
.  Cook to 165 deg internal temp.
OPTIONS: Roast, Broil, BraiseRT97r#1038rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 40 min or one side
.  of gas grill 10 min-lid closed.
2. Season 1 pound ribs per person.
3. Bank coals in one half of grill
.  or reduce gas heat toward Low.
4. Place ribs bone side down on cool
.  side. Close lid. Cook 90 min.
.  Turn after 45 min. Add coals to
.  keep chamber air temp at 300 deg.
5. Baste with sauce in last 20 min.
OPTIONS: Braise & Finish on GrillRT97r#1039rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 40 min or one side
.  of gas grill 10 min-lid closed.
2. Season 1 pound ribs per person.
3. Bank coals in one half of grill
.  or reduce gas heat toward Low.
4. Place ribs bone side down on cool
.  side. Close lid. Cook 75 min.
.  Turn after 45 min. Add coals to
.  keep chamber air temp at 300 deg.
5. Baste with sauce in last 20 min.
