2. Grill 4" above Medium heat.
.  Hold palm just above grate. If
.  heat causes you to pull away in 4
.  seconds, heat is ideal (375 deg).
3. For 3/4 to 1-inch thick steak,
.  cook 7-9 min/side for MedRare or
.  10-12 min/side for Medium. Cook
.  to 140 or 150 deg internal temp.
