Product of USRT97r#2210rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Place brisket in stock pot. Add
.  water to cover. Add 25 black
.  peppercorns and 2 bay leaves.
2. Bring to a slow simmer. Cover
.  pot. Cook 3 hours over Low heat
.  or until fork tender.
3. Optional: add 1 head cabbage, cut
.  into wedges, during last 20 min.
.  of cooking. Remove from heat.
4. Slice thinly across the grain.
