OPTION: Deep FryRT97r#2229rt1. Season steak with lemon pepper
.  and garlic salt, or as desired.
2. Heat 1 Tbsp. oil in skillet over
.  Med-High. Brown steaks 2 min/side.
3. Add 1/4 cup each water and tomato
.  sauce. Cover steak with finely
.  chopped tomato, onion, bell
.  pepper, chilies and cilantro.
4. Cover tightly. Simmer gently
.  over very Low heat 35 to 45 min.
OPTIONS: Pan Broil, Cube & Stew
