.  large skillet over Med-High heat.
2. Brown steaks 2 min/side. Wipe oil
.  from skillet. Add 1/2 cup beef
.  broth, water or other liquid. Add
.  chopped vegetables, if desired.
3. Cover tightly. Simmer gently
.  over Low heat 30 min. or until
.  tender. Add liquid if needed.
4. Thicken pan juices for gravy.
