Product of USRT97r#2310rt1. Turn steak in seasoned flour.
2. Heat 1 Tbsp. oil over Medium heat
.  in a large skillet. Brown steak 2
.  min/side. Wipe oil from skillet.
3. Add 1 cup beef broth. Cover.
