.seconds,heat is ideal (375 deg).
3. Grill 8-10 mins per side
.  or until internal temperature
.  raches 140-145 degrees.
4. Slice across the grain to serve.RT97r#2418rt--COOKING STEPS--
1. Heat charcoal 30 min. Heat gas
a .  grill 10 min. with LiD CLosed.
2. Grill 4" above Medium heat.
.  Hold palm just above grate. If
.  heat causes you to pull away in 4
.seconds,heat is ideal (375 deg).
3. Grill 7-9 minutes per side for
.  Med-Rare or Med. Remove when 140
.  or 150 deg internal temperature.
OPTIONS: Broil, Pan BroilRT97r#2420rtINGS: SHRIMP, SODIUM TRIPOLYPHOSPHATE
and Sodium Bisulfite
1. Add 1'' water to large pot. Bring
.  to a rapid boil over High heat.
2. Place shrimp on a
.  steamer rack over water. Cover
.pot with a tight fitting lid.
3. Cook 1 pound 2 minutes until
.  pink and firm. Do not overcook.
4. Drain. Rinse under cold water.
5. Serve with your favorite sauce.
OPTIONS: Boil, Saute, Stir FryRT97r#2421rtAllow 1/2 lb. uncooked per serving.
1. Heat oven to 425 degrees.
2. season roast. Place a rack
.  in a shallow pan.
3. Roast, uncovered, in center of
.  oven 50-60 minutes. Remove
.  when a meat thermometer inserted
.  in center, not touching bone,
.  reads 135 degrees for Medium Rare
4. Let stand 10 min. before carving.
OPTIONS: Indirect Grill, Rotisserie
Product of USRT97r#2422rt-------COOKING STEPS--DEEP FRY------
1. Remove head, fins, tail & scales.
.  Score fish sides twice. Rinse.
2. Heat enough oil in 3 qt sauce pan
.  over Med-High for meat to float.
3. Coat with flour. Dip in milk or
.  beaten egg. Coat in New Orleans
.  Fish Fry or favorite seasoned
.  breading mix.
4. Fry in 375 deg oil 4-5 min until
.  golden. Drain on rack.
OPTIONS: Grill, Bake, Pan FryRT97r#2423rtAllow 1/2 lb. uncooked per serving.
1. Heat oven to 300 degrees.
2. Season roast. Place bone side
.  down on a rack in a shallow pan.
3. Roast, uncovered, in center of
.  oven 16-20 min/lb if7 ribsor
.  24-28 min/lb if 4 ribs. Remove
.  when meat thermometer inserted in
.  center, not touching bone or fat,
.  reads 130-135 deg for Med-Rare.
4. Let stand 20 min. before carving.
Product of USRT97r#2424rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Arrange charcoal in half of grill
.  and heat 30 min. or heat one side
.  of gas grill 10 min-lid closed.
2. Sear meat directly over heat 2
.  min/side then move to cool side.
3. Cook 14 mins with lid closed.
.  Keep air temp in chamber at 350-
.  375 degress.
4. Baste after 10 minutes. Cook meat
.  to 145 degrees internal temp.
OPTIONS: Braise, RoastRT97r#2426rt--COOKING STEPS--
1. Heat charcoal 30 min. until ash
.  covered or gas grill 10 min-lid
.  closed. Clean and oil grate well.
2. Grill 4" above Medium heat.
.  Hold palm just above grate. If
.heat causes you to pull away in 4
.  seconds, heat is ideal (375 deg).
3. Cook 8-10 min/side. Remove when 165
.  degree internal temperature.
OPTIONS: Braise, Stew, Pan FryRT97r#2428rt1. Heat non-stick or heavy skillet 2
.  minutes over Medium heat. This is
