Product of USRT97r#2433rt-------COOKING STEPS--DEEP FRY------
1. Heat enough oil in deep skillet
.  over Med-High for meat to float.
2. Coat with flour. Dip in milk or
.  beaten egg. Coat in New Orleans
.  Fish Fry or mix 3/4 c. cornmeal,
.  1/4 c. flour and salt, cayenne
.  and garlic powder to taste.
