Serve w/ Hot Pepper or Tartar SauceRT97r#2434rt---------COOKING STEPS--BAKE---------
1. Heat oven to 450 degrees.
2. Marinate or baste fillets with
.  sauce, oil or seasoned butter.
3. Measure at thickest point.
4. Bake in upper 1/3 of oven 10 min
.  per inch of thickness until fish
.  just begins to flake when tested
.  with a fork and color turns from
.  translucent to opaque or white.
.  (145 degrees internal temperature)
