OPTION: Braise on Stove TopRT97r#2475rt.    Shrimp Campechana (Mexican-Style
.  Shrimp Cocktail) is a delicious
.  cold appetizer.
.    For a beautiful presentation
.  spoon into a margarita or
.  martini glass with sliced avocado,
.  cilantro sprigs, or a lime wedge
.  on the edge.
.    Serve with tortilla chips and
.  chopped jalapenos.RT97r#2476rt.    Enjoy this delicious creamy
.  shrimp salad as a great appetizer,
.  light meal, or as a side salad to
.  a larger meal. Serve on crackers,
.  in lettuce bowls, or stuff in a
.  fresh tomato.
.  It also makes a great sandwich,
.  just heap the shrimp salad onto
.  bread and then cut sandwiches in
.  half. serve with lettuce and
.  tomato, if desired.RT97r#2477rt.    Seafood Dips and Spreads offer
.  a delightful appetizer in an
.  instant and get your party off to
.  a great start. They are a crowd
.  pleaser and will be the hit at
.  any gathering.
.    Serve with toasted French bread
.  slices, crackers toast points,
.  pita triangles, chips or dipping
.  vegetables.RT97r#2478rt---------COOKING STEPS--BAKE---------
