1. Blend 3/4 cup flour and 3/4 tsp.
.  each salt and pepper on a plate.
.  Put 1 cupbread crumbs on another
.  plate. Beat 2 eggs in a bowl.
2. Turn meat in flour, then egg,
.  then bread crumbs to coat.
3. Heat 1/4 cup each oil and butter
.  over Med-High. Fry 1-2 min/side.
