5. Make sauce or gravy, if desired.
OPTIONS: Stir Fry, Pan Broil
Product of USRT97r#2739rt1. Season beef cubes as desired.
2. Heat 2 Tbsp oil in stock pot over
.  Medium heat. Brown beef 5 min.
3. Optional: remove beef to brown
.  vegetables separately. Combine.
4. Add broth, water,wine or liquid
.  to cover beef cubes. Add chopped
.  vegetables. Bring to a boil.
4. Cover and simmer gently over Low
.  heat 45 min. or until tender.
.  Do not boil or meat will toughen.
Product of USRT97r#2740rt--COOKING STEPS--GRILL--
1. Heat charcoal 40 min until ash
.  covered or gas grill 10 min with
.  lid closed.
2. Grill 4'' above Medium-Low heat.
.  Hold palm just above grate. If
.  heat causes you to pull away in 5
.  seconds, heat is ideal (325 deg).
3. Cook approximately 7-8 minutes per
.  side. Remove and serve.
OPTIONS: Microwave, SteamRT97r#2741rt1. Cut each steak into 3 portions.
