Product of U S.RT97r#2772rt1. Heat oven to 300 deg. Rub both
.  sides of ribs with seasonings.
2. Place ribs on a rack in a large
.  shallow pan. Add 1 cup water to
.  bottom of pan. Cover with foil.
.  Seal tightly to enclosesteam.
3. Cook in center of oven 1 1/2 hrs.
4. Finish ribs by grilling 12-15 min
.  over Medium heat (375 deg surface
.  temp is ideal). Turn every 5 min.
