.  on rack in shallow roasting pan.
4. Bake 40 to 50 min. until a meat
.  thermometer in center of thickest
.  part of thigh reads 170-180 degrees.
.  (Stuffing must reach 165 degrees.)
5. Let stand 5 min. before carving.
