Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2874rt--COOKING STEPS--
1. Heat enough oil in a 3 quart Sauce
.  Pan over Medium-High heat for
.  Brisket Chunks to float.
2. Season with salt, black pepper and
.  garlic powder to taste.
3. Fry in 375 degree oil 4-5 min,
.  or until browned.
4. Drain on rack.
