Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2879rt1. Season brisket pieces as desired.
2. Heat 1 Tbsp. oil in deep skillet
.  or Dutch oven over Medium heat.
3. Brown brisket pieces 2 min/side.
4. Add 1/2 cup beef broth, beer or
.  water. Add chopped vegetables, if
.  desired. Cover tightly.
5. Simmer gently in a 325 deg oven
.  or over Low heat 2 to 2 1/2 hours
.  or until tender.
6. Thicken pan juices for gravy.
Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2880rt1. Season brisket as desired.
2. Heat 1 Tbsp. oil in deep skillet
.  or Dutch oven over Medium heat.
3. Brown brisket 3 minutes per side.
4. Add 1/2 cup beef broth, beer or
.  water. Add chopped vegetables, if
.  desired. Cover tightly.
5. Simmer gently in a 325 deg oven
.  or over Low heat 3-4 hrs or until
.  tender. Add liquid if needed.
6. Thicken pan juices for gravy.
Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2881rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Marinate in liquid smoke. Drain.
2. Heat oven to 325 degs. Season with
.  garlic, onion and celery salts.
3. Place in a large roasting pan.
.  Cover tightly. Cook 2 1/2 hours or
.  until tender.
4. Slice 1/4-inch thick across grain
5. Serve with barbecue sauce.
OPTIONS: Indirect Grill, Smoke
