Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2885rt1. Heat charcoal 40 min or one side
.  of gas grill 10 min-lid closed.
2. Season 1 pound ribs per person.
3. Bank coals in one half of grill
.  or reduce gas heat toward Low.
4. Place ribs boneside down on cool
.  side. Close lid. Cook 90 min.
.  Turn after 45 min. Add coals to
.  keep chamber air temp at 300 deg.
5. Baste with sauce in last 20 min.
OPTIONS: Braise & Finish on Grill
Product of US, MEXICORT97r#2886rt1. Arrange charcoal in half of grill
.  and heat 30 min. or heat one side
.  of gas grill 10 min-lid closed.
2. Season or marinate beef.
3. Sear beef over heat 2 min/side.
.  Move to cool half of grill. Cook
.  14 min with lid closed. Keep air
.  temp in chamber at 350-375 deg.
4. Baste after 10 minutes. Cook meat
.  to 145 degrees internal temp.
