.  seconds, heat is ideal (375 deg).
3. For 3/4" steak, cook 4-5 min/side
.  for MedRare-Med. For 1", 7-8 or
.  9-11 min/side for MR or MD. Cook
.  to 140 or 155 deg internal temp.
