Slice thinly across the grain.
OPTIONS:Stir Fry,Bread & Fry,Pan FryRT97r#7631rt-------Cooking Steps--Steam-------
1. Cook 1-1 1/2 lb. lobster/person.
2. Bring 1" water and 2 Tbsp salt to
.   a rapid boil in a large pot.
3. Add lobsters. Cover with a lid.
.   Cook 2 lb lobster 20 min once
.   water returns to a boil. Remove
.   when tail reaches 140 degrees
.   internal temp. Add 2-3 min cook
.   time for each 1/4 lb over 2 lb.
4. Serve with melted butter & lemon.
OPTIONS: Boil, Split & Bake or GrillRT97r#7687rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 30 min until ash
.   covered or gas grill 10 min-lid
.   closed. Season chops.
2. Grill 4" above Medium heat. Hold
.   palm just above grate. If heat
.   causes you to pull away in 4
.   seconds,heat is ideal 375 deg,
3. Cook 6-7 min/side until center
.   of chop is almost firm to touch.
.   Cook to 150 deg internal temp.
OPTIONS: Bake/Roast,Broil,Pan BroilRT97r#7688rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
1. Heat charcoal 30 min until ash
.   covered or gas grill 10 min-lid
.   closed. Season chops.
2. Grill 4" above Medium heat. Hold
.   palm just above grate. If heat
.   causes you to pull away in 4
.   seconds,heat is ideal 375 deg,
3. Cook 5 min/side until center
.   of chop is almost firm to touch.
.   Cook to 150 deg internal temp.
OPTIONS: Bake/Roast,Broil,Pan BroilRT97r#7689rt----------COOKING STEPS------------
